[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative\nterminal.</p><p>Place the car on a lift.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a) for the parking sensors\n(1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K97A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K97B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K97C</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K97D</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064849.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Release the coupling for the parking sensor wiring (1a) from\nthe mounting bracket (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064850.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical coupling between the rear wiring and\nthe parking sensor wiring.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Join for parking sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D89</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064851.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Release the electrical wiring\nfor the parking sensors from the retaining clips and remove it from\nits housing.</p>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check the condition of the\nelectrical wiring.</p><p>If necessary, carry out any continuity\nchecks.</p><p>If the wiring is damaged, proceed with\nreplacing it.</p><p>Fit the electrical wiring in place, securing\nit to the retaining clips.</p><p>Connect the electrical coupling between\nthe rear wiring and the parking sensor wiring.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Join for parking sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D89</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the coupling for the parking sensor\nwiring to the mounting bracket.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections for\nthe parking sensors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K97A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K97B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K97C</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K97D</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]